<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct tax collection up 20.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct tax collection up 20.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China collected 510 billion yuan ($61.4 billion) in industrial and commercial taxes in the first 10 months of 1996, up 20.3 percent from the year-ago period, the official Xinhua news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>The collected amount accounted for 84.6 percent of the year's target, the agency said. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
